Package: ncfigR
Title: NC-Style Bioinformatics Figure Toolkit
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Jiang", family = "Congxin", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "jcx981212@163.com")
Author: Jiang Congxin
Maintainer: Jiang Congxin <jcx981212@163.com>
Description: R tools for drawing bioinformatics panels from source-data tables, arranging composite figures, and exporting traceable figure bundles. Includes optional Seurat adapters and shared themes and palettes for single-cell, spatial, communication, trajectory, and benchmark figures.
